# Smart Card Parking Management System

## Project Overview
A Smart Parking Management System developed using Python and Data Structure and Algorithms.

## Features
- Vehicle Registration
- Smart Card ID Management
- Vehicle Entry and Exit
- Automatic Parking Slot Allocation
- Waiting Queue Management
- Parking Status Display
- Vehicle Search with Slot Number

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Streamlit

## Data Structures Used
- List
- Dictionary
- Deque

